    "faqs": [
        {
            "category": "General",
            "question": "Why should I choose Kovai Kalaimagal College of Arts and Science?",
            "answer": "Kovai Kalaimagal College of Arts and Science (KKCAS) is an autonomous institution graded 'A+' by NAAC. We prioritize a research-oriented environment, strong industry collaboration for placements, excellent academic results, state-of-the-art facilities across 10-acres of green campus, and a focus on raising professionals with strong morals."
        },
        {
            "category": "General",
            "question": "About this college?",
            "answer": "Established in 1996, Kovai Kalaimagal College is run by the Kovai Kalaimagal Educational Trust. Our motto is 'Light the Light Within', reflecting our goal to empower students and foster both academic and personal excellence."
        },
        {
            "category": "Admission",
            "question": "How can I apply?",
            "answer": "You can apply online via our website or visit the campus directly with your essential documents like 12th marksheets, ID proof, and photographs. Admissions are purely merit-based."
        },
        {
            "category": "Fees",
            "question": "What is the fee structure?",
            "answer": "The fee structure varies based on the course you select. Typically, undergraduate (UG) programs range from ₹84,000 to ₹1,50,000 for the entire duration, while PG courses like MBA can be around ₹2,20,000. It is best to visit the college admission office for exact details."
        },
        {
            "category": "Hostel",
            "question": "Are hostel facilities available?",
            "answer": "Yes, we proudly provide secure hostel facilities for both boys and girls within the college campus. Both hostels have a capacity of 102 students each and offer excellent amenities like indoor games, mess, and 24/7 security."
        },
        {
            "category": "Placements",
            "question": "How are the placements?",
            "answer": "We have an exceptional placement record with an active Training and Placement Cell. Our recruiters include top-tier companies like Amazon, Cognizant, Infosys, and TCS. Last year, a vast majority of students successfully found jobs right from the campus."
        }
    ],
